OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road near airport shut due  
OL,4,Ato herd of horses                      
OL,6,FA busy route near Birmingham Airport   
OL,7,Fhas been shut due to a herd of escaped 
OL,8,Fhorses.                                
OL,10,FThe A446 in Warwickshire was closed in 
OL,11,Fboth directions on Sunday morning      
OL,12,Fbetween Junction 4 of the M6 and the   
OL,13,FA452 at Stonebridge.                   
OL,15,FNational Highways reported police      
OL,16,Fdealing with a herd of horses roaming  
OL,17,Fin the carriageway.                    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
