OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road near airport shut due  
OL,4,Ato herd of horses                      
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the agency said:    
OL,7,F"West Midlands Police continue to work 
OL,8,Fat the scene to round up the horses,   
OL,9,Fwith efforts being made to identify the
OL,10,Fowner so they can be collected."       
